# The -oentity axis of the architectural stream: the generated end-prolog
# carries the META-DTD, so the writer defines the ARCHITECTURE's entities (the
# copies mungeMetaDtd made, in the meta table's bucket order) rather than the
# document's. Same model as synth-arc-27 — reused rather than copied, so the two
# entries cannot drift apart.
DOC=af-27.sgml
WORKDIR=../synth-arc-27
EXTRA_ARGS="-A open -oentity"
